R709=build('t_9edf120e470a',709,'商量','to discuss or deliberate',['consult about','reason over'],['discuss','deliberate','consult','consider together','reason about','talk it over'],'Eight works show one act of considering or discussing, used both for actual consultation and for criticized conceptual working.',O709,'To discuss or deliberate is to work something over in speech or thought, alone or with another person.','Nanquan says that he and Guizong have discussed phrases together and invites a capable participant to come out and discuss; Fengxue asks whether discussion belongs in the quarters or tea hall. Other speakers turn the same act into a warning. Dahui forbids reckless deliberation after the Second Patriarch’s bow and catalogues “needle-and-thread” discussions of an old case; Sanyi Mingyu rejects making Buddhist analysis of a rain display. Baoen Yuan says even “nothing-to-do discussion” is grit in the eye, while a verse speaks of ages spent deliberating. Zen does not give the word one stance: public consultation and the criticized working-over of cases are attested uses of the same act.','The records make deliberation itself a public topic: invited as encounter, located institutionally, catalogued as case interpretation, and rejected when it substitutes analysis for the event.','The word does not inherently mean mistaken conceptualization; several witnesses use it neutrally for discussion between participants.',['話會','擬議','卜度','公案','問答'],['Baoen Yuan','Dahui Zonggao','Fengxue Yanzhao','Nanquan Puyuan','Guizong Zhichang','Sanyi Mingyu'],['work:wudeng-quanshu','work:guzunsu-yulu','chan:zhiyue-lu','work:X81n1568','chan:zongjian-falin','work:wudeng-huiyuan','work:X64n1260','work:liandeng-huiyao'])

